sections.body:
下面检查一个声道的归一化 PCM 数值，范围采用 start 包含、end 不包含。seamJump 是最后一个样本到首样本的幅度差；RMS 是一段样本的均方根幅度，用来提示能量变化。它们不计算节拍、响度标准或音乐质量，也不返回“合格”。

保存为 loop-audit.mjs，运行 node loop-audit.mjs，无依赖。三条 48 kHz、1 秒数值信号只是实验输入：440 Hz 整周期、440.25 Hz 非整周期、以及把整周期信号前后各 100 毫秒置零。没有音频文件输出或播放。

```js
/**
 * @file Inspect numerical loop boundaries; this does not certify audible quality.
 * @author liliwei
 * @date 2026-11-11
 * @LastEditors liliwei
 * @LastEditTime 2026-11-11
 */
/** @param {ArrayLike<number>} pcm Mono normalized samples. @param {number} rate Samples per second.
 * @param {number} start Inclusive frame. @param {number} end Exclusive frame.
 * @param {number} edge Frames in each edge window. @returns {object} Boundary and energy measurements.
 */
export function inspectLoop(pcm, rate, start = 0, end = pcm?.length, edge = 480) {
  if (!(Array.isArray(pcm) || pcm instanceof Float32Array || pcm instanceof Float64Array)
    || !Number.isFinite(rate) || rate <= 0
    || ![start, end, edge].every(Number.isSafeInteger)
    || start < 0 || end > pcm.length || edge < 1 || end - start <= 2 * edge) {
    throw new Error('Invalid loop range');
  }
  for (let i = start; i < end; i++) {
    if (!Number.isFinite(pcm[i]) || Math.abs(pcm[i]) > 1) throw new Error('Invalid PCM sample');
  }
  /** @param {number} a Inclusive frame. @param {number} b Exclusive frame. @returns {number} RMS amplitude. */
  const rms = (a, b) => {
    let sum = 0;
    for (let i = a; i < b; i++) sum += pcm[i] * pcm[i];
    return Math.sqrt(sum / (b - a));
  };
  return {
    seconds: (end - start) / rate,
    seamJump: Math.abs(pcm[start] - pcm[end - 1]),
    headRms: rms(start, start + edge),
    tailRms: rms(end - edge, end),
    bodyRms: rms(start + edge, end - edge)
  };
}
const rate = 48000;
/** @param {number} hz Frequency of a mathematical test signal. @returns {Float64Array} One second of samples. */
const tone = hz => Float64Array.from({ length: rate }, (_, i) => .5 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * hz * i / rate));
const continuous = tone(440), cut = tone(440.25), mutedEnds = tone(440);
mutedEnds.fill(0, 0, 4800); mutedEnds.fill(0, rate - 4800);
for (const [name, pcm] of Object.entries({ continuous, cut, mutedEnds })) {
  console.log(name, JSON.stringify(inspectLoop(pcm, rate)));
}
```

edge=480 在 48 kHz 下是 10 毫秒，只是本例观察窗。真实工程按采样率换算窗口，对左右声道分别检查；先混成单声道可能因反相抵消而掩盖问题。Float PCM 超出本例的 ±1 合同会拒绝，需要另做峰值与导出处理，不应偷偷裁掉异常样本。
